{"id":"563f382027630287","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-substructure.md","title":"Substructure","display":"df-substructure — Substructure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-substructure","aliases":["58-df-substructure","58-df-zfc-model-substructure","58-df-zfc-model5-substructure"],"display":"df-substructure — Substructure","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-substructure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-substructure</span><span>58-df-zfc-model-substructure</span><span>58-df-zfc-model5-substructure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-substructure — Substructure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,\\mathcal L\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,\\mathcal L\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span> (structure predicate and universe operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Cst},\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\">\\(\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Cst},\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\)</span> (language symbols)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Substructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Substructure}_S\\)</span> (substructure predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substructure} \\vdash \\mathrm{Substructure}_S(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal B)\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Cst}\\;(c^{\\mathcal A}=c^{\\mathcal B})\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)^n\\;(f^{\\mathcal A}(\\bar a)=f^{\\mathcal B}(\\bar a))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\;(R^{\\mathcal A}=R^{\\mathcal B}\\cap\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)^n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substructure} \\vdash \\mathrm{Substructure}_S(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal B)\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Cst}\\;(c^{\\mathcal A}=c^{\\mathcal B})\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)^n\\;(f^{\\mathcal A}(\\bar a)=f^{\\mathcal B}(\\bar a))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\;(R^{\\mathcal A}=R^{\\mathcal B}\\cap\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)^n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substructure\\text{-}implicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{Substructure}_S(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal L\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Substructure}_S(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,\\mathcal L)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substructure\\text{-}implicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{Substructure}_S(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal L\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Substructure}_S(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,\\mathcal L)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Substructures inherit functions and relations by restriction.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-model-substructure</code> and <code>58-df-zfc-model5-substructure</code> are aliases of this same structure-restriction idea.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}_S$ and $\\mathrm{Univ}$ (structure predicate and universe operator, see [[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,\\mathcal L\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Univ}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Cst},\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Substructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substructure} \\vdash \\mathrm{Substructure}_S(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal B)\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Cst}\\;(c^{\\mathcal A}=c^{\\mathcal B})\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)^n\\;(f^{\\mathcal A}(\\bar a)=f^{\\mathcal B}(\\bar a))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\;(R^{\\mathcal A}=R^{\\mathcal B}\\cap\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)^n)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substructure\\text{-}implicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{Substructure}_S(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal L\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Substructure}_S(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,\\mathcal L)","display":true}],"bytes":1709,"backlinks":[{"id":"8cddb830164d6d0b","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Substructure}_S$ (substructure predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-substructure.md]])"},{"id":"08e8a43c15b7f036","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (see [[58-df-satisfaction]]), $\\mathrm{Assign}$ (see [[58-df-assignment]]), $\\mathrm{Substructure}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[58-df-substructure]]), and $\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)$ (see [[58-df-formula]])"},{"id":"42db21ac702cc072","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"510228b78bbea773","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Substructure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-substructure.md]])"},{"id":"25c32e58877e8a51","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Substructure}_S$ (substructure predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-substructure.md]])"},{"id":"27ecffcf5f27b448","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5589a1d0971a3224","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Substructure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\to